<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>两种画错</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>对照</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 472, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginRight: 18, padding: 28, background: 'rgba(180,85,45,0.08)', height: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B4552D' }}>画成关系网</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 16 }}>谁认识谁、谁能帮谁——这是“谁认识谁”。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 8 }}>差序格局问的是：谁在谁里面。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 28, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', height: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>箭头空着</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 16 }}>圈画得很圆，一个字没写。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 8 }}>位置关系说不出来，就等于没画。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 3 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>09/18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>